            One speaks of a
            %strong unital comonoid
            (or
            = succeed ";" do
              %strong unital comonoid object
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/internalization"} internal to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vect"} Vect
            also called an
            = succeed ")" do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/augmented+algebra"} augmented
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coalgebra"} coalgebra
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi C
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C
            is in addition equipped with a morphism
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
